<?xml version='1.0' standalone='yes'?>
<!DOCTYPE PLUGIN [
  <!ENTITY name "waz.dashboard">
  <!ENTITY author "TheIlluminate92">
  <!ENTITY version "2026.10.24.08">
  <!ENTITY pluginURL "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheIlluminate92/unraid-dashboard/main/releases/waz.dashboard.plg">
]>

<PLUGIN name="&name;" author="&author;" version="&version;" pluginURL="&pluginURL;" min="7.2.0" icon="waz.dashboard.png" launch="Dashboard">
<CHANGES>
### 2026.10.24.08
- Softer Home Assistant-inspired navy cards, rounded edges and pill controls.
- Existing layout, pool/health colors and refresh behavior preserved.

### 2026.10.24.07
- 250 ms Server Status with five-minute charts.
- One-second selected running-container stats when visible; inventory and other dashboard data retain their slower refresh intervals.

### 2026.10.24.06
- Consolidated attention list, useful collapsed summaries and compact CPU overview.
- Pool-colored bays with cached SMART details; selecting a bay never probes a drive.

### 0.8.5 - Build 2026.10.24.05
- Keeps Drives &amp; Storage full-width, with Server Status and Workloads side by side on screens at least 1200px wide. Narrower screens retain one stacked column.

### 0.8.5 - Build 2026.10.24.04
- Drive-first full-width dashboard rows, readable bay labels and collapsible enclosures. Selecting a bay opens details beneath its enclosure; a single drawer is open at a time.
- Collapses secondary system, workload, pool, parity and array details while keeping health alerts visible. Preserves plugin geometry and zero-based numbering.
- Persists live SAS identity, pool-label and cancelled-parity fixes. No management-daemon, array, service or Disk Location configuration changes.

### 0.8.5 - Build 2026.10.24.03
- Extends move/resize layout editing to Workloads and Storage, with independent per-panel settings and reset.
- Workloads summary tiles and folder/container/process/detail sections are editable; Storage parity, pools, pool details, locations and array sections are editable.
- Preserves existing Server Status layouts, native Docker actions, pool selection and pool-only hiding. Panels grow naturally instead of clipping resized blocks to Server Status height.

### 0.8.5 - Build 2026.10.24.02
- Hostname-based banner names, movable and resizable Server Status sections and summary tiles, keyboard layout controls, reset and per-browser saved layouts.
- Hides absent hardware, shares local/network UPS telemetry between health and power, and preserves communication fault reporting. Does not change UPS shutdown settings.
- Corrects retained healthcheck results on stopped or paused containers.
- Reads Disk Location group names, shapes and numbering directions with zero-based labels and drive-identity validation. Does not change plugin-owned mappings.

### 0.8.5 - Build 2026.10.22.04
- Keeps the wrench, time and uptime anchored to the right independently of optional fan controls.
- Supports combined cooling status: hides the MD12xx control when no shelves are present and shows an IPMI status link only when chassis control is available. Chassis faults contribute to cooling/overall health.

### 0.8.4 - Build 2026.10.22.03
- Adds socket summaries with expandable physical cores and logical threads. Remembers expansion choices, separates repeated core IDs across sockets, and calculates combined utilization from valid weighted counter deltas. Adds CPU rendering and aggregation regression tests.
- Supports pool-only systems: hides the array section when no array is assigned, excludes empty disk slots, and reports unconfigured parity without false failures. Assigned missing disks still raise faults.
- Hides unavailable MD12xx fan controls and skips polling absent fan and HBA Viewer plugins. Stops on confirmed missing endpoints while retrying transient failures.
- Adds a bundled dashboard icon and direct Dashboard launch link. Asset cache versions now follow the package build.

### 0.8.3 - Build 2026.10.20.01
- Restricts the GPU worker to CLI, serializes instances and reaps its child. Removes full process arguments from responses, reports missing required sensors as unknown, and validates a staged runtime before activation with rollback. Adds regression coverage, PHP compatibility CI and migration documentation. No live installation or 7.4 hardware certification is claimed.

### 2026.10.12.01 - Waz Dashboard v0.8.2

- Standardizes visible author attribution to TheIlluminate92; project credits are retained.
- Separates application and Unraid build metadata in telemetry.
- Rejects noncanonical installer filenames and duplicate internal-name registrations before runtime changes.
- Keeps the canonical update URL and persistent settings.

### 2026.09.07.01 - WAZ System v0.8.1

- Fixes disk-temperature severity to honor Unraid's per-device and global HDD/SSD thresholds.
- Treats zero-valued Unraid temperature thresholds as disabled.
- Integrates the sticky WAZ Health banner, live collectors, thresholds, local time, and uptime into the dashboard plugin.
- Adds a blue wrench to the WAZ Health header that opens Unraid's native Tile Management window.
- Registers the stable release manifest with Unraid Plugin Manager for normal update checks and one-click updates.
- Matches the banner to the System, Workloads, and Storage dark palette.
- Migrates standalone WAZ Health settings and recoverably disables its old plugin manifest to prevent duplicate loaders.
- Imports live Docker groups from FolderView Plus and Unraid's native Docker Organizer, with existing FolderView formats retained as fallbacks.
- Adds compact Workloads and Storage attention rows that identify the exact container, parity, pool, array, disk, temperature, capacity, or telemetry problem.
- Adds a SERVER STATUS header to the left panel and moves its LIVE indicator from the footer to the header.
- Removes redundant physical-location labels from Array rows because the Disk Location section already maps every disk.
- Moves Docker-vdisk used/total capacity into the Workloads summary.
- Removes the redundant Docker-vdisk row from the left System memory section and its snapshot payload.
- Replaces the Health summary with Issues: unhealthy containers plus stopped containers whose last exit code was non-zero.
- Builds folders from supported Docker folder labels when no FolderView configuration file exists.
- Removes the redundant selected-container process list while retaining the permanent Top 4 host-process table.
- Removes all secondary text from the four Workloads summary cells.
- Clarifies Health as passing Docker HEALTHCHECK results versus containers that define a health check.
- Imports Docker folders from FolderView3 and compatible FolderView/FolderView2 configurations, including BOM-prefixed JSON.
- Adds the full-height Workloads center panel with FolderView3-aware Docker folders and remembered selection.
- Opens Unraid's native Docker controls from each container icon while loading selected-container telemetry below.
- Adds selected-container CPU, RAM, network, disk I/O, pool access, GPU attribution, status, sparklines, and mini process details.
- Adds a permanent live Top 4 host-process table with Docker attribution immediately above the selected-container inspector.
- Removes the redundant native System and Docker dashboard tiles without modifying Unraid core files.
- Displays storage capacities using decimal KB/MB/GB/TB units.
- Keeps every normal pool-button border blue while restoring each pool's identity color to its percentage value and top bar.
- Labels the parity devices Parity 1 and Parity 2 and replaces duplicate validity text with last- and next-check timing.
- Calculates the next parity check from Unraid's generated schedule and custom week-of-month setting.
- Restyles normal pool cards with cool-blue borders and values while retaining identity colors only in their top bars.
- Preserves Disk Location geometry while renumbering only usable bays: R360 1-8 and each MD1200 1-12.
- Enlarges Array rows and lets them consume the remaining matched panel height.
- Adds the WAZ Storage right-column panel with compact parity status, remembered pool selectors, live pool members, three physical shelf maps, empty bays, and a permanent dynamic two-column Array table.
- Uses Unraid's cached disk telemetry and Disk Location's saved assignments without waking sleeping drives.
- Synchronizes the Storage panel height to the System panel.
- Displays network download and upload side by side with equal width and distinct colors.
- Adds live RAM, log-filesystem, and Docker-vdisk usage bars to the Memory section.
- Reorders the 3x3 status board into CPU/GPU/Power, RAM/Coolant/HBA 0, and Network/Flow/HBA 1 rows.
- Removes the redundant standalone GPU detail section.
- Keeps GPU load, active process names, and video load in the top status board.
- Increases status, section, core, legend, detail, and footer text sizes.
- Renames Server Power to Rack Power and calculates it from UPS load and nominal output.
- Expands the top status board to a 3x3 system summary.
- Adds coolant flow as its own status tile.
- Adds both HBA temperatures through HBA Viewer's shared cached export API.
- Slightly increases status and section label sizes.
- Consolidates CPU, cooling, and power into the top status board.
- Removes the redundant WAZ System heading, allocation drawer, and thermal strip.
- Removes duplicate headline values from the detail sections for a one-screen layout.
- Increases the entire panel to a readable dashboard scale.
- Reduces both history graphs to two-thirds of their prior height.
- Rebuilds System as a native one-column Unraid dashboard panel.
- Adds live CPU topology, memory, network, power, and cooling telemetry.
- Adds best-effort Intel GPU and video process attribution.
- Replaces 100 ms server polling with one combined snapshot per second.
- Keeps persistent settings during forced rolling updates.
- Integrates the compact header fan control with the dedicated MD12xx Fan Control plugin API.
- Displays API-provided shelf names, RPM, health, mode, targets, and supported manual speeds without owning hardware policy.
- Leaves serial access, temperature curves, discovery, commissioning, telemetry verification, and supervision to the dedicated plugin.
</CHANGES>

<!-- Stop the prior watcher before replacing the RAM-backed runtime tree. -->
<!-- Unraid names inline scripts after the installer basename. Reject aliases before touching runtime/config. -->
<FILE Run="/bin/bash">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
set -e
case "${0##*/}" in
  inline1-waz.dashboard.sh) ;;
  *)
    echo "Refusing a noncanonical installer filename. Save/install this package as waz.dashboard.plg."
    echo "Do not uninstall an alias registration: it may share configuration with the canonical plugin."
    exit 1
    ;;
esac
php <<'PLUGIN_REGISTRATION_CHECK'
<?php
$canonical = 'waz.dashboard.plg';
foreach (['/boot/config/plugins', '/var/log/plugins'] as $directory) {
    foreach (glob($directory . '/*.plg') ?: [] as $path) {
        if (basename($path) === $canonical) continue;
        libxml_use_internal_errors(true);
        $manifest = @simplexml_load_file($path, 'SimpleXMLElement', LIBXML_NONET);
        if ($manifest !== false && (string)$manifest['name'] === 'waz.dashboard') {
            file_put_contents('php://stderr', "Duplicate plugin registration: " . basename($path) . "\n");
            file_put_contents('php://stderr', "Back up shared data and migrate the registration before updating. Do not use Uninstall.\n");
            exit(1);
        }
    }
}
PLUGIN_REGISTRATION_CHECK
]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>

<FILE Run="/bin/bash">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
set -e

RUNTIME_DIR="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/waz.dashboard"
CONFIG_DIR="/boot/config/plugins/waz.dashboard"
CONFIG_FILE="$CONFIG_DIR/waz.dashboard.cfg"
MD12XX_API="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/md12xx.fancontrol/include/api.php"

if [ -f "$CONFIG_FILE" ] && grep -Eqi '^MD1200_ENABLED="?(yes|true|1|on)"?$' "$CONFIG_FILE"; then
  MD12XX_STATUS=""
  if [ -f "$MD12XX_API" ]; then
    MD12XX_STATUS="$(/usr/bin/php "$MD12XX_API" 2>/dev/null || true)"
  fi
  if ! printf '%s' "$MD12XX_STATUS" | /usr/bin/php -r '$status=json_decode(stream_get_contents(STDIN),true); exit(is_array($status) && !empty($status["enabled"]) ? 0 : 1);'; then
    echo "WAZ's legacy MD1200 controller is enabled, but the dedicated MD12xx Fan Control API does not report an enabled replacement." >&2
    echo "Install, commission, and enable MD12xx Fan Control first, or explicitly disable MD1200_ENABLED in $CONFIG_FILE, then retry this update." >&2
    exit 1
  fi
fi

# Populate a separate tree while the installed runtime keeps running.
[ ! -L "/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged" ] || { echo "Staging path is a symlink" >&2; exit 1; }
rm -rf -- "/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged"
mkdir -p "/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged" "$CONFIG_DIR"
]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>

<FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged/assets/css/banner.css">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
:root {
  --waz-health-background: #111417;
  --waz-health-raised: #1b2025;
  --waz-health-border: #303840;
  --waz-health-text: #e6edf3;
  --waz-health-muted: #87939f;
  --waz-health-cyan: #22b8f0;
  --waz-health-normal: #35c46a;
  --waz-health-attention: #f2a900;
  --waz-health-fault: #e55454;
  --waz-health-unknown: #87939f;
}

#waz-health-banner.waz-health {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  position: sticky;
  top: var(--waz-health-sticky-top, 0);
  z-index: 100;
  width: 100%;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 40px;
  height: auto;
  margin: 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--waz-health-border);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--waz-health-border);
  background: var(--waz-health-background);
  color: var(--waz-health-text);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  line-height: 1;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__inner {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: clamp(10px, 1.4vw, 24px);
  width: 100%;
  height: 39px;
  padding: 0 clamp(12px, 2vw, 28px);
  overflow-x: auto;
  overflow-y: hidden;
  scrollbar-width: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__issues {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: none;
  align-items: center;
  gap: clamp(18px, 2.5vw, 36px);
  min-height: 30px;
  padding: 5px clamp(12px, 2vw, 28px) 6px;
  overflow-x: auto;
  overflow-y: hidden;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--waz-health-border);
  background: #0e1114;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

#waz-health-banner.waz-health--expanded .waz-health__issues {
  display: flex;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__issue {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  color: var(--waz-health-muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.035em;
  text-transform: none;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__issue strong {
  color: inherit;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__inner::-webkit-scrollbar {
  display: none;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__identity {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__overall,
#waz-health-banner .waz-health__subsystem,
#waz-health-banner .waz-health__meta,
#waz-health-banner .waz-health__uptime {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__overall {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  gap: 7px;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__subsystems {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-start;
  flex: 0 1 auto;
  gap: clamp(10px, 1.35vw, 22px);
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__subsystem {
  gap: 6px;
  color: var(--waz-health-muted);
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__divider {
  flex: 0 0 1px;
  align-self: stretch;
  height: 18px;
  margin: auto 0;
  background: var(--waz-health-border);
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__dot {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: inline-block;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 7px;
  height: 7px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--waz-health-unknown);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--waz-health-unknown) 16%, transparent);
}

#waz-health-banner [data-state="normal"] .waz-health__dot {
  background: var(--waz-health-normal);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--waz-health-normal) 16%, transparent);
}

#waz-health-banner [data-state="attention"] {
  color: var(--waz-health-attention);
}

#waz-health-banner [data-state="attention"] .waz-health__dot {
  background: var(--waz-health-attention);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--waz-health-attention) 18%, transparent);
}

#waz-health-banner [data-state="fault"] {
  color: var(--waz-health-fault);
}

#waz-health-banner [data-state="fault"] .waz-health__dot {
  background: var(--waz-health-fault);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--waz-health-fault) 18%, transparent);
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__right {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  gap: clamp(12px, 1.3vw, 20px);
  margin-left: auto;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__meta {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  gap: clamp(12px, 1.3vw, 20px);
  margin-left: 0;
  color: var(--waz-health-muted);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__modules {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  border-radius: 3px;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--waz-health-cyan);
  font: inherit;
  line-height: 1;
  cursor: pointer;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__modules[hidden] {
  display: none;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__modules:hover,
#waz-health-banner .waz-health__modules:focus-visible {
  border-color: var(--waz-health-border);
  outline: none;
  background: var(--waz-health-raised);
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__modules:focus-visible {
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--waz-health-cyan) 28%, transparent);
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fans {
  display: inline-flex;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 9px;
  margin-left: 0;
  color: var(--waz-health-text);
  letter-spacing: 0.045em;
}

#waz-health-banner [hidden] {
  display: none !important;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fans-label,
#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fan-readings {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fan-readings {
  color: var(--waz-health-muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fans[data-state="attention"] .waz-health__fans-label {
  color: var(--waz-health-attention);
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fans[data-state="fault"] .waz-health__fans-label {
  color: var(--waz-health-fault);
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fans--disabled {
  opacity: 0.58;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fan-select {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  height: 25px;
  min-width: 72px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 23px 0 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--waz-health-border);
  border-radius: 3px;
  background: var(--waz-health-raised);
  color: var(--waz-health-text);
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 0.055em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fan-select:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--waz-health-cyan);
  outline-offset: 1px;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fan-select:disabled {
  cursor: not-allowed;
  opacity: 0.65;
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__uptime {
  gap: 4px;
}

#waz-health-banner[data-connection="offline"] .waz-health__uptime {
  opacity: 0.55;
}

@supports not (color: color-mix(in srgb, white, black)) {
  :root {
    --waz-health-background: #111417;
    --waz-health-border: #303840;
    --waz-health-muted: #87939f;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  #waz-health-banner .waz-health__inner {
    height: 38px;
  }

  #waz-health-banner .waz-health__divider {
    display: none;
  }

  #waz-health-banner .waz-health__subsystems {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  #waz-health-banner .waz-health__fan-readings {
    display: none;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 620px) {
  #waz-health-banner .waz-health__inner {
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 0 12px;
  }

  #waz-health-banner .waz-health__identity {
    position: sticky;
    left: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    margin-left: -12px;
    padding: 13px 10px 13px 12px;
    background: var(--waz-health-background);
  }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  #waz-health-banner * {
    scroll-behavior: auto !important;
  }
}

#waz-health-banner .waz-health__issues { flex-wrap: wrap; white-space: normal; }
#waz-health-banner .waz-health__issue { line-height: 1.5; }

/* Match the WAZ panels without changing sticky behavior or state colors. */
#waz-health-banner.waz-health {
  --waz-health-background: #0f172b;
  --waz-health-raised: #17223b;
  --waz-health-border: rgb(182 194 225 / 16%);
  --waz-health-text: #f3f1fc;
  --waz-health-muted: #a7b3ce;
  --waz-health-cyan: #8ecbff;
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  border-radius: 0 0 14px 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
}
#waz-health-banner .waz-health__issues { background: #0c1324; border-radius: 0 0 14px 14px; }
#waz-health-banner .waz-health__fan-select { border-radius: 999px; }

]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>
<FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged/assets/css/layout.css">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
[data-dashboard-layout] [data-layout-group] { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px; align-items: start; }
[data-dashboard-layout] [data-layout-group="sections"] { margin-top: 8px; }
[data-dashboard-layout] [data-layout-item] { position: relative; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
[data-dashboard-layout] [data-layout-group="sections"] > [data-layout-item] { grid-column: span 12; margin: 0; }
[data-dashboard-layout] .waz-layout-sized { overflow: auto; }
[data-dashboard-layout] [hidden] { display: none !important; }
.waz-layout-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; }
.waz-layout-actions button, .waz-layout-controls button { background: #26323b; color: var(--waz-cyan); border: 1px solid #456070; border-radius: 3px; padding: 3px 6px; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
.waz-layout-controls { display: flex; gap: 3px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-bottom: 5px; }
.waz-layout-editing [data-layout-item] { outline: 1px dashed var(--waz-cyan); }
.waz-layout-editing .waz-layout-controls { position: relative; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.waz-layout-grip { position: absolute; bottom: 0; right: 0; padding: 2px 5px; color: var(--waz-cyan); cursor: nwse-resize; touch-action: none; background: #26323b; z-index: 2; }
.waz-workloads[data-dashboard-layout], .waz-storage[data-dashboard-layout] { height: auto !important; overflow: visible; }
.waz-workloads[data-dashboard-layout] .waz-workloads-summary > [data-layout-item] { min-height: 70px; background: var(--waz-panel); padding: 8px; }
@media (max-width: 600px) { [data-dashboard-layout] [data-layout-item] { grid-column: span 12 !important; } }

/* Scope the row layout to dashboards containing the WAZ drive panel. */
div.grid:has(#waz-storage-tile) { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) !important; }
div.grid:has(#waz-storage-tile) > #tile3 { order: -1; grid-column: 1 / -1; }
@media (min-width: 1200px) {
  div.grid:has(#waz-storage-tile) { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)) !important; }
}
.waz-secondary-panel { border: 1px solid #303840; padding: 12px; }
.waz-secondary-panel > summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px; }
.waz-secondary-panel > section { margin-top: 12px; }
[data-dashboard-layout="storage"] > [data-layout-group] > [data-layout-item="locations"] { grid-column: 1 / -1 !important; height: auto !important; }
.waz-storage .waz-storage-section > summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 4px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
.waz-storage .waz-storage-section > summary > span { float: right; font-size: 14px; color: var(--waz-muted); }
/* Flex display on details would reveal closed contents. */
.waz-storage details.waz-storage-section { display: block; }
.waz-workloads[data-dashboard-layout], .waz-storage[data-dashboard-layout] { min-height: 0; }

.waz-secondary-panel > summary { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 20px; }
.waz-secondary-panel > summary::before { content: '▸'; }
.waz-secondary-panel[open] > summary::before { content: '▾'; }
.waz-secondary-panel > summary > span { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; color: #b6c3ce; }
.waz-cpu-detail > summary { cursor: pointer; padding: 10px 4px; }
#waz-cpu-overview { margin-left: 12px; color: var(--waz-cyan); }
.waz-hardware-unavailable { opacity: .65; }
/* Detailed issues live once in the health banner; retain local fallback if it is absent. */
body:has(#waz-health-banner) #waz-storage-alert,
body:has(#waz-health-banner) #waz-workloads-alert { display: none; }

]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>
<FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged/assets/css/polish.css">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
/* Surface treatment from the owner's Home Assistant Phone dashboard.
   Layout, bay geometry, assignment colors and state colors belong to their
   existing styles; this layer changes only the WAZ presentation. */
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile) {
  --waz-bg: #0f172b;
  --waz-panel: #111a2f;
  --waz-raised: #17223b;
  --waz-border: rgb(182 194 225 / 16%);
  --waz-text: #f3f1fc;
  --waz-muted: #a7b3ce;
  --waz-cyan: #8ecbff;
  --waz-violet: #c2a5ff;
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

div.tile:has(:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)) {
  border-radius: 22px;
  background: #0f172b;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgb(0 0 0 / 14%);
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile) > tr > td {
  border-radius: 22px;
}

:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(.waz-block, .waz-secondary-panel, .waz-workloads-section, .waz-storage-section, .waz-location-group) {
  border-radius: 18px;
  border-color: var(--waz-border);
  background: var(--waz-panel);
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(.waz-system-header, .waz-workloads-header, .waz-storage-header) b {
  font-weight: 650;
  letter-spacing: .025em;
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(.waz-summary, .waz-workloads-summary, .waz-selected-metrics) {
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  border-radius: 14px;
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(.waz-summary-cell, .waz-workloads-summary > div, .waz-selected-metrics > div) {
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 0%, rgb(194 165 255 / 7%), transparent 78%), var(--waz-raised);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--waz-border);
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(.waz-folder-tab, .waz-container-card, .waz-pool-tab, .waz-parity-disk, .waz-pool-member, .waz-array-disk) {
  border-radius: 12px;
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(.waz-folder-tab, .waz-container-card):not(.waz-selected) {
  border-color: var(--waz-border);
}
#waz-workloads-tile :is(.waz-folder-tab, .waz-container-card).waz-selected {
  border-color: var(--waz-cyan);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(142 203 255 / 20%);
}
#waz-storage-tile .waz-bay { border-radius: 10px; }
#waz-storage-tile .waz-bay-details {
  border-radius: 18px;
  border-color: var(--waz-border);
  background: var(--waz-raised);
  box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgb(0 0 0 / 12%);
}
#waz-system-tile :is(.waz-cpu-socket, .waz-core, .waz-chart-wrap, .waz-network-chart-wrap),
#waz-workloads-tile :is(.waz-selected-charts > div, .waz-selected-detail-grid > div, .waz-process-row) {
  border-radius: 10px;
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(.waz-meter, .waz-storage-meter, .waz-disk-meter) {
  border-radius: 999px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(.waz-layout-actions button, .waz-layout-controls button, .waz-bay-details > button) {
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid var(--waz-border);
  background: var(--waz-raised);
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  padding: 5px 10px;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(button, summary, [role="button"]) {
  transition: background-color 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease;
}
:is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
:is(button, summary, [role="button"]):focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--waz-cyan);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}
@media (hover: hover) {
  :is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile)
  :is(.waz-layout-actions button, .waz-layout-controls button, .waz-bay-details > button):hover {
    background: #223253;
    border-color: var(--waz-cyan);
  }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  :is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile) *,
  :is(#waz-system-tile, #waz-workloads-tile, #waz-storage-tile) *::before {
    transition: none !important;
    animation: none !important;
  }
}

]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>
<FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged/assets/css/storage.css">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
#waz-storage-tile {
  --waz-bg: #111417;
  --waz-panel: #1b2025;
  --waz-raised: #22282e;
  --waz-border: #303840;
  --waz-text: #e6edf3;
  --waz-muted: #87939f;
  --waz-cyan: #22b8f0;
  --waz-green: #35c46a;
  --waz-amber: #f2a900;
  --waz-red: #e55454;
  --waz-violet: #a78bfa;
  color: var(--waz-text);
}

#waz-storage-tile > tr > td {
  background: var(--waz-bg);
  border-color: var(--waz-border);
}

.waz-storage,
.waz-storage * {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.waz-storage {
  display: flex;
  min-height: 620px;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.waz-storage-header,
.waz-storage-section-head,
.waz-pool-detail-head,
.waz-storage-footer {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8px;
}

.waz-storage-header {
  padding: 2px 2px 8px;
}

.waz-storage-header b {
  display: block;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 18px;
}

.waz-storage-header small {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 14px;
}

.waz-storage-health {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  color: var(--waz-green);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .07em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-storage-health i,
.waz-disk-state {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: currentColor;
}

.waz-disk-state {
  margin-right: 4px;
  color: var(--waz-green);
  vertical-align: 1px;
}

.waz-disk-state.waz-is-sleeping { color: var(--waz-muted); }
.waz-disk-state.waz-is-attention { color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-disk-state.waz-is-fault { color: var(--waz-red); }

.waz-storage-health.waz-is-loading { color: var(--waz-muted); }
.waz-storage-health.waz-is-attention { color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-storage-health.waz-is-fault { color: var(--waz-red); }

.waz-storage-alert {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  padding: 6px 8px;
  border: 1px solid rgb(242 169 0 / 38%);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--waz-amber);
  background: rgb(242 169 0 / 8%);
  color: #f4c658;
  font-size: 10.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 14px;
}

.waz-storage-alert.waz-is-fault {
  border-color: rgb(229 84 84 / 42%);
  border-left-color: var(--waz-red);
  background: rgb(229 84 84 / 8%);
  color: #f08080;
}

.waz-storage-alert[hidden], .waz-array-section[hidden] { display: none; }

.waz-storage-section {
  margin-top: 8px;
  padding: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--waz-border);
  background: var(--waz-panel);
}

.waz-storage-section:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }

.waz-storage-section-head {
  min-height: 14px;
}

.waz-storage-section-head b {
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: .075em;
  line-height: 14px;
}

.waz-storage-section-head > span {
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 14px;
}

.waz-storage-meter,
.waz-disk-meter {
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #0b0d0f;
}

.waz-storage-meter {
  height: 6px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-disk-meter { height: 4px; }

.waz-storage-meter i,
.waz-disk-meter i {
  display: block;
  width: 0;
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--disk-color, var(--waz-cyan));
  transition: width .45s ease-out;
}

.waz-parity-body {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(140px, 1.35fr);
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-parity-disks {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 5px;
}

.waz-parity-disk,
.waz-pool-member,
.waz-array-disk {
  position: relative;
  min-width: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid rgb(135 147 159 / 17%);
  background: var(--waz-raised);
}

.waz-parity-disk::before,
.waz-pool-member::before,
.waz-array-disk::before,
.waz-bay::before,
.waz-pool-tab::before {
  position: absolute;
  content: '';
  background: var(--disk-color, var(--waz-cyan));
}

.waz-parity-disk::before,
.waz-pool-member::before,
.waz-array-disk::before {
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 3px;
}

.waz-parity-disk {
  padding: 5px 6px 5px 9px;
}

.waz-parity-disk b,
.waz-pool-member b {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 14px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-parity-disk small,
.waz-pool-member small {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  line-height: 12px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-parity-summary {
  min-width: 0;
  align-self: center;
}

.waz-parity-summary strong,
.waz-parity-summary small {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-parity-summary strong {
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 15px;
}

.waz-parity-summary small {
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 13px;
}

.waz-pool-tabs {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 5px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-pool-tab {
  position: relative;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 7px 6px 5px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid #34566b;
  background: var(--waz-raised);
  color: var(--waz-text);
  cursor: pointer;
  font: inherit;
  text-align: left;
}

.waz-pool-tab::before {
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  left: 0;
  height: 2px;
}

.waz-pool-tab:hover,
.waz-pool-tab.waz-selected {
  border-color: var(--waz-cyan);
}

.waz-pool-tab b,
.waz-pool-tab strong,
.waz-pool-tab small {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-pool-tab b {
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  letter-spacing: .045em;
  line-height: 12px;
}

.waz-pool-tab strong {
  margin-top: 2px;
  color: var(--disk-color, var(--waz-cyan));
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 17px;
}

.waz-pool-tab small {
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 9px;
  line-height: 11px;
}

.waz-pool-detail {
  margin-top: 6px;
  padding-top: 6px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgb(135 147 159 / 16%);
}

.waz-pool-detail-head strong {
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-size: 11px;
}

.waz-pool-detail-head span {
  color: var(--disk-color, var(--waz-cyan));
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.waz-pool-detail > .waz-storage-meter i {
  background: var(--waz-cyan);
}

.waz-pool-tab.waz-is-attention { border-color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-pool-tab.waz-is-fault { border-color: var(--waz-red); }

.waz-pool-members {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 5px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-pool-member {
  padding: 4px 6px 4px 9px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.waz-location-groups {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 7px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-location-group {
  min-width: 0;
}

.waz-location-group > b {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 13px;
  text-align: center;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-location-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--columns, 5), minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 3px;
}

.waz-location-grid[data-tray-direction="v"] .waz-bay { min-height: 64px; }

.waz-bay {
  position: relative;
  min-width: 0;
  height: 26px;
  padding: 3px 2px 2px 5px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--waz-border);
  background: #15191d;
  cursor: pointer;
  text-align: center;
}

.waz-bay::before {
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 3px;
}

.waz-bay.waz-empty {
  cursor: default;
  opacity: .62;
}

.waz-bay.waz-hidden {
  visibility: hidden;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.waz-bay b,
.waz-bay small {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  line-height: 10px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-bay b {
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-size: 9px;
}

.waz-bay small {
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 8px;
}

.waz-is-attention:not(.waz-storage-health) { border-color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-is-fault:not(.waz-storage-health) { border-color: var(--waz-red); }
.waz-is-selected { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--waz-cyan); }

.waz-array-section {
  display: flex;
  min-height: 0;
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.waz-array-disks {
  display: grid;
  min-height: 0;
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 4px 6px;
  margin-top: 6px;
  overflow: auto;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
}

.waz-array-column {
  display: grid;
  min-width: 0;
  grid-auto-rows: minmax(28px, 1fr);
  gap: 4px;
}

.waz-array-disk {
  display: grid;
  min-height: 28px;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(70px, 1fr) 38px minmax(64px, 1fr);
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 4px 5px 4px 8px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 14px;
}

.waz-array-disk a {
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-array-temp {
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-array-temp { text-align: right; }

.waz-array-usage {
  display: grid;
  min-width: 0;
  grid-template-columns: 27px minmax(0, 1fr);
  align-items: center;
  gap: 3px;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  text-align: right;
}

.waz-storage-footer {
  padding: 6px 2px 0;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 13px;
}

@media (max-width: 620px) {
  .waz-location-groups { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .waz-pool-tabs { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .waz-storage { height: auto !important; overflow: visible; }
}

/* Physical maps retain the plugin's rows, columns and bay order. */
.waz-storage .waz-location-groups { display: block; }
.waz-location-group { margin: 16px 0; border: 1px solid var(--waz-border); padding: 12px; border-radius: 4px; }
.waz-location-group > summary { cursor: pointer; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 0 12px; }
.waz-enclosure-scroll { overflow-x: auto; padding: 3px; }
.waz-storage .waz-location-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--columns, 4), minmax(120px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; }
.waz-storage .waz-location-grid[data-tray-direction="v"] { grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--columns, 8), minmax(64px, 1fr)); }
.waz-storage .waz-bay { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 100%; height: 84px; padding: 10px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
.waz-storage .waz-location-grid[data-tray-direction="v"] .waz-bay { min-height: 112px; }
.waz-storage .waz-bay b { font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; }
.waz-storage .waz-bay small { font-size: 14px; line-height: 18px; white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; writing-mode: horizontal-tb; }
.waz-bay-state { font-size: 11px; line-height: 16px; color: var(--waz-muted); }
.waz-is-fault .waz-bay-state { color: var(--waz-red); }
.waz-is-attention .waz-bay-state { color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-storage .waz-bay:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--waz-cyan); outline-offset: 2px; }
.waz-drive-hint { color: var(--waz-muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 8px 0; }
.waz-bay-details { margin-top: 14px; padding: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--waz-cyan); background: var(--waz-panel); }
.waz-bay-details h3 { display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 12px 12px 0; }
.waz-bay-details > button { float: right; padding: 8px 12px; cursor: pointer; }
.waz-bay-details dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(190px,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin: 0; }
.waz-bay-details dt { color: var(--waz-muted); font-size: 13px; }
.waz-bay-details dd { margin: 3px 0 0; font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

.waz-drive-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 20px; margin: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; }
.waz-drive-legend span::before { content: ''; display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 3px; margin-right: 7px; background: var(--disk-color); }
.waz-storage .waz-bay:not(.waz-empty):not(.waz-hidden) { border: 2px solid var(--disk-color); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--disk-color) 16%, var(--waz-panel)); }
.waz-storage .waz-bay.waz-is-attention .waz-bay-state,
.waz-storage .waz-bay.waz-is-fault .waz-bay-state { font-weight: 800; border: 1px solid currentColor; padding: 0 5px; border-radius: 3px; }

]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>
<FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged/assets/css/system.css">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
#waz-system-tile {
  --waz-bg: #111417;
  --waz-panel: #1b2025;
  --waz-raised: #22282e;
  --waz-border: #303840;
  --waz-text: #e6edf3;
  --waz-muted: #87939f;
  --waz-cyan: #22b8f0;
  --waz-teal: #2dd4bf;
  --waz-green: #35c46a;
  --waz-amber: #f2a900;
  --waz-red: #e55454;
  --waz-violet: #a78bfa;
  color: var(--waz-text);
}

#waz-system-tile > tr > td {
  background: var(--waz-bg);
  border-color: var(--waz-border);
}

#waz-system-tile .tile-header-main,
#waz-system-tile .section,
#waz-system-tile .section > span {
  color: var(--waz-text);
}

.waz-freshness {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: .38rem;
  color: var(--waz-green);
  font-size: .72rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-freshness i {
  width: .5rem;
  height: .5rem;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: currentColor;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgb(53 196 106 / 12%);
}

.waz-freshness.waz-is-loading { color: var(--waz-muted); }
.waz-freshness.waz-is-stale { color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-freshness.waz-is-fault { color: var(--waz-red); }

.waz-system {
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  color: var(--waz-text);
}

.waz-system-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 2px 2px 8px;
}

.waz-system-header b {
  display: block;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 18px;
}

.waz-system-header small {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 14px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-system-header .waz-freshness {
  gap: 5px;
  font-size: 10px;
}

.waz-system-header .waz-freshness i {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  box-shadow: none;
}

.waz-summary {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 1px;
  padding: 1px;
  border: 1px solid var(--waz-border);
  background: var(--waz-border);
}

.waz-summary-cell {
  min-width: 0;
  padding: .58rem .7rem;
  background: var(--waz-panel);
}

.waz-system .waz-summary-cell { min-height: 70px; height: auto; }

.waz-summary-cell span,
.waz-block-header b {
  display: block;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: .68rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .075em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.waz-summary-cell strong {
  display: block;
  margin-top: .16rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.2;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-summary-cell.waz-accent-gpu strong { color: var(--waz-violet); }
.waz-summary-cell.waz-accent-cooling strong { color: var(--waz-teal); }
.waz-summary-cell.waz-accent-hba strong { color: var(--waz-teal); }
.waz-summary-cell strong.waz-temp-attention { color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-summary-cell strong.waz-temp-fault { color: var(--waz-red); }
.waz-summary-cell strong.waz-temp-unknown { color: var(--waz-muted); }

.waz-summary-cell strong.waz-network-pair {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 6px;
}

.waz-network-pair em {
  min-width: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-size: inherit;
  font-style: normal;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-network-pair em + em {
  color: var(--waz-violet);
  text-align: right;
}

.waz-block {
  margin-top: .75rem;
  padding: .72rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--waz-border);
  background: var(--waz-panel);
}

.waz-block-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: .75rem;
}

.waz-block-header > span {
  min-width: 0;
}

.waz-block-header small {
  display: block;
  margin-top: .16rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: .75rem;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.25;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-block-header > strong {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-size: 1.16rem;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.waz-chart-wrap,
.waz-network-chart-wrap {
  position: relative;
  height: 78px;
  margin-top: .55rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--waz-border);
  background: var(--waz-bg);
}

.waz-chart-wrap > span,
.waz-network-key {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 1;
  top: .28rem;
  left: .38rem;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: .62rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .065em;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.waz-chart-wrap svg,
.waz-network-chart-wrap svg {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.waz-chart-wrap line,
.waz-network-chart-wrap line {
  stroke: rgb(135 147 159 / 18%);
  stroke-width: 1;
  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
}

#waz-cpu-chart-line,
#waz-network-rx-line,
#waz-network-tx-line {
  fill: none;
  stroke: var(--waz-cyan);
  stroke-width: 2;
  stroke-linecap: round;
  stroke-linejoin: round;
  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
}

#waz-network-tx-line { stroke: var(--waz-violet); }

.waz-network-key i {
  display: inline-block;
  width: .42rem;
  height: .42rem;
  margin-right: .18rem;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--waz-cyan);
}

.waz-network-key i:nth-of-type(2) {
  margin-left: .42rem;
  background: var(--waz-violet);
}

.waz-core-list {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: .34rem;
  margin-top: .55rem;
}

.waz-core {
  min-width: 0;
  padding: .38rem .44rem;
  border: 1px solid rgb(135 147 159 / 16%);
  background: var(--waz-raised);
}

.waz-core-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: .4rem;
  margin-bottom: .24rem;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: .65rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.waz-thread {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2.25rem minmax(0, 1fr) 2.2rem;
  align-items: center;
  gap: .3rem;
  font-size: .68rem;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.waz-thread > b {
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-weight: 500;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-thread > em {
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-style: normal;
  text-align: right;
}

.waz-mini-meter,
.waz-meter {
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #0b0d0f;
}

.waz-mini-meter { height: 4px; }
.waz-meter { height: 6px; margin-top: .55rem; }

.waz-mini-meter i,
.waz-meter i {
  display: block;
  width: 0;
  height: 100%;
  background: var(--waz-cyan);
  transition: width .55s ease-out;
}

.waz-detail-line,
.waz-member {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: .5rem;
  margin-top: .34rem;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: .7rem;
}

.waz-memory-block .waz-meter i { background: var(--waz-cyan); }

.waz-resource-row {
  margin-top: 7px;
}

.waz-resource-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8px;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .055em;
  line-height: 13px;
}

.waz-resource-head span {
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-size: 11.5px;
  letter-spacing: 0;
}

.waz-resource-row .waz-meter {
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.waz-resource-row .waz-detail-line {
  margin-top: 3px;
}

.waz-network-chart-wrap { height: 62px; }

.waz-member-list {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: .35rem;
  margin-top: .42rem;
}

.waz-member {
  margin: 0;
  padding: .35rem .42rem;
  background: var(--waz-raised);
}

.waz-member b { color: var(--waz-text); }
.waz-member span { white-space: nowrap; }

.waz-state-dot {
  display: inline-block;
  width: .42rem;
  height: .42rem;
  margin-right: .25rem;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--waz-green);
}

.waz-state-dot.waz-down { background: var(--waz-red); }

.waz-system-footer {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: .5rem;
  padding: .48rem .08rem 0;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: .62rem;
  letter-spacing: .02em;
}

.waz-muted { color: var(--waz-muted); }

/* Unraid's dashboard uses a reduced root font size. Keep this panel readable
   with an explicit pixel scale while it remains inside one native column. */
#waz-system-tile .tile-header-main {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 18px;
}

#waz-system-tile .section > span {
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 15px;
}

.waz-freshness {
  gap: 5px;
  font-size: 9px;
}

.waz-freshness i {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
}

.waz-summary-cell {
  padding: 9px 11px;
}

.waz-summary-cell span,
.waz-block-header b {
  font-size: 9px;
  line-height: 12px;
}

.waz-summary-cell strong {
  margin-top: 3px;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 17px;
}

.waz-block {
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding: 10px;
}

.waz-block-header {
  gap: 10px;
}

.waz-block-header small {
  margin-top: 3px;
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 15px;
}

.waz-block-header > strong {
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 19px;
}

.waz-chart-wrap {
  height: 106px;
  margin-top: 8px;
}

.waz-network-chart-wrap {
  height: 82px;
  margin-top: 8px;
}

.waz-chart-wrap > span,
.waz-network-key {
  top: 5px;
  left: 6px;
  font-size: 9px;
}

.waz-network-key i {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
}

.waz-core-list {
  gap: 6px;
  margin-top: 8px;
}

.waz-core {
  padding: 6px 7px;
}

.waz-core-head {
  gap: 6px;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
  font-size: 9px;
  line-height: 12px;
}

.waz-thread {
  grid-template-columns: 38px minmax(0, 1fr) 35px;
  gap: 5px;
  font-size: 10.5px;
  line-height: 18px;
}

.waz-mini-meter { height: 5px; }
.waz-meter { height: 7px; margin-top: 8px; }

.waz-detail-line,
.waz-member {
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 6px;
  font-size: 10.5px;
  line-height: 15px;
}

.waz-member-list {
  gap: 6px;
  margin-top: 7px;
}

.waz-member {
  padding: 6px 7px;
}

.waz-state-dot {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  margin-right: 4px;
}

.waz-system-footer {
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 8px 2px 0;
  font-size: 9px;
  line-height: 12px;
}

/* Compact one-screen layout. The status board owns headline telemetry and the
   sections below provide detail without repeating the same large values. */
.waz-summary {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
}

.waz-summary-cell {
  padding: 7px 9px;
}

.waz-summary-cell strong {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 18px;
}

.waz-summary-cell small {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 13px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-summary-cell > span,
.waz-block-header b {
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 14px;
}

.waz-block-header small {
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 16px;
}

.waz-chart-wrap > span,
.waz-network-key {
  font-size: 10px;
}

.waz-block {
  margin-top: 8px;
  padding: 8px;
}

.waz-chart-wrap {
  height: 70px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-network-chart-wrap {
  height: 54px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-core-list {
  gap: 4px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-core {
  padding: 5px 6px;
}

.waz-core-head {
  margin-bottom: 2px;
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 12px;
}

.waz-thread {
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 17px;
}

.waz-meter {
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-detail-line,
.waz-member {
  margin-top: 4px;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 16px;
}

.waz-member-list {
  margin-top: 5px;
}

.waz-member {
  padding: 5px 6px;
}

.waz-system-footer {
  align-items: center;
  padding-top: 6px;
}

.waz-system-footer {
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 13px;
}

@media (max-width: 520px) {
  .waz-summary { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .waz-core-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* Native disclosures provide socket, physical-core, and logical-thread stages. */
#waz-core-list { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }

.waz-cpu-socket {
  min-width: 0;
  border: 1px solid rgb(135 147 159 / 16%);
  background: var(--waz-raised);
}

.waz-cpu-summary {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 10px minmax(0, 1fr) 38px 48px;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 7px;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  cursor: pointer;
  list-style: none;
  font-size: 11.5px;
  line-height: 16px;
}

.waz-cpu-summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
.waz-cpu-summary::before { content: '▸'; color: var(--waz-muted); }
details[open] > .waz-cpu-summary::before { content: '▾'; }
.waz-cpu-summary:hover { background: rgb(135 147 159 / 8%); }
.waz-cpu-summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--waz-cyan); outline-offset: -2px; }
.waz-cpu-summary-name { min-width: 0; }
.waz-cpu-summary-name b,
.waz-cpu-summary-name small { display: block; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.waz-cpu-summary-name small { color: var(--waz-muted); font-size: 10px; }
.waz-cpu-summary em { color: var(--waz-cyan); font-style: normal; text-align: right; }
.waz-cpu-summary-temp { color: var(--waz-muted); text-align: right; }

.waz-socket-cores {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 4px;
  padding: 0 5px 5px;
}

.waz-socket-cores > .waz-core { padding: 0; align-self: start; }
.waz-core > .waz-cpu-summary { grid-template-columns: 8px minmax(0, 1fr) 30px 42px; gap: 4px; padding: 5px; }
.waz-core-threads { padding: 0 5px 5px; }
.waz-core-threads .waz-thread { grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(16px, 1fr) 34px; }

@media (max-width: 520px) {
  .waz-socket-cores { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
}

]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>
<FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged/assets/css/workloads.css">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
#waz-workloads-tile {
  --waz-bg: #111417;
  --waz-panel: #1b2025;
  --waz-raised: #22282e;
  --waz-border: #303840;
  --waz-text: #e6edf3;
  --waz-muted: #87939f;
  --waz-cyan: #22b8f0;
  --waz-teal: #2dd4bf;
  --waz-green: #35c46a;
  --waz-amber: #f2a900;
  --waz-red: #e55454;
  --waz-violet: #a78bfa;
  color: var(--waz-text);
}

#waz-workloads-tile > tr > td {
  background: var(--waz-bg);
  border-color: var(--waz-border);
}

.waz-workloads,
.waz-workloads * { box-sizing: border-box; }

.waz-workloads {
  display: flex;
  min-height: 620px;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.waz-workloads-header,
.waz-workloads-section-head,
.waz-workloads-footer,
.waz-inspector-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 8px;
}

.waz-workloads-header { padding: 2px 2px 8px; }

.waz-workloads-header b {
  display: block;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 18px;
}

.waz-workloads-header small {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 14px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-workloads-health {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  color: var(--waz-green);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .07em;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-workloads-health i,
.waz-container-state {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: currentColor;
}

.waz-workloads-health.waz-is-loading { color: var(--waz-muted); }
.waz-workloads-health.waz-is-attention { color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-workloads-health.waz-is-fault { color: var(--waz-red); }

.waz-workloads-alert {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  padding: 6px 8px;
  border: 1px solid rgb(242 169 0 / 38%);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--waz-amber);
  background: rgb(242 169 0 / 8%);
  color: #f4c658;
  font-size: 10.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 14px;
}

.waz-workloads-alert.waz-is-fault {
  border-color: rgb(229 84 84 / 42%);
  border-left-color: var(--waz-red);
  background: rgb(229 84 84 / 8%);
  color: #f08080;
}

.waz-workloads-alert[hidden] { display: none; }

.waz-workloads-summary {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 1px;
  padding: 1px;
  border: 1px solid var(--waz-border);
  background: var(--waz-border);
}

.waz-workloads-summary > div {
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 7px 8px;
  background: var(--waz-panel);
}

.waz-workloads-summary span,
.waz-workloads-section-head b,
.waz-selected-metrics span,
.waz-selected-detail-grid b {
  display: block;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .07em;
  line-height: 13px;
}

.waz-workloads-summary strong {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 18px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-workloads-summary > div:nth-child(2) strong { color: var(--waz-green); }
.waz-workloads-summary > div:nth-child(3) strong { color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-workloads-summary > div:nth-child(4) strong { color: var(--waz-violet); }

.waz-workloads-section {
  margin-top: 8px;
  padding: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--waz-border);
  background: var(--waz-panel);
}

.waz-workloads-section-head { min-height: 14px; }

.waz-workloads-section-head > span {
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-size: 10px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 13px;
}

.waz-folder-tabs {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 5px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-folder-tab {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 43px;
  grid-template-columns: 27px minmax(0, 1fr);
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 5px 6px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid #34566b;
  background: var(--waz-raised);
  color: var(--waz-text);
  cursor: pointer;
  font: inherit;
  text-align: left;
}

.waz-folder-tab::before {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  left: 0;
  height: 2px;
  content: '';
  background: var(--folder-color, var(--waz-cyan));
}

.waz-folder-tab:hover,
.waz-folder-tab.waz-selected { border-color: var(--waz-cyan); }

.waz-folder-tab img,
.waz-folder-fallback {
  width: 25px;
  height: 25px;
  object-fit: contain;
}

.waz-folder-fallback {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  color: var(--folder-color, var(--waz-cyan));
  font-size: 20px;
}

.waz-folder-tab b,
.waz-folder-tab small {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-folder-tab b { font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 13px; }
.waz-folder-tab small { color: var(--waz-muted); font-size: 9px; line-height: 12px; }

.waz-container-section {
  display: flex;
  min-height: 112px;
  flex: 1 1 180px;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.waz-container-grid {
  display: grid;
  min-height: 0;
  flex: 1 1 auto;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
  grid-auto-rows: minmax(74px, auto);
  align-content: start;
  gap: 6px;
  margin-top: 6px;
  overflow: auto;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
}

.waz-container-card {
  position: relative;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 62px;
  padding: 5px 4px 4px;
  border: 1px solid rgb(135 147 159 / 17%);
  background: var(--waz-raised);
  cursor: pointer;
  text-align: center;
}

.waz-container-card:hover,
.waz-container-card.waz-selected { border-color: var(--waz-cyan); }
.waz-container-card.waz-selected { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(34 184 240 / 25%); }

.waz-container-icon {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
}

.waz-container-icon img {
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  object-fit: contain;
}

.waz-container-card.waz-stopped .waz-container-icon img { filter: grayscale(1); opacity: .52; }

.waz-container-state {
  position: absolute;
  right: -2px;
  bottom: 0;
  color: var(--waz-green);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--waz-raised);
}

.waz-container-card.waz-paused .waz-container-state { color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-container-card.waz-stopped .waz-container-state,
.waz-container-card.waz-unhealthy .waz-container-state { color: var(--waz-red); }

.waz-container-card b {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 2px;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-size: 9.5px;
  line-height: 12px;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  text-overflow: clip;
  white-space: normal;
  word-break: break-word;
}

.waz-container-badges {
  position: absolute;
  top: 3px;
  right: 3px;
  display: grid;
  gap: 2px;
  color: var(--waz-violet);
  font-size: 8px;
}

.waz-container-badges .waz-update { color: var(--waz-amber); }

.waz-process-head,
.waz-process-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(70px, .85fr) 42px 42px;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}

.waz-process-head {
  margin-top: 5px;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 8.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .06em;
}

.waz-process-row {
  min-height: 22px;
  margin-top: 3px;
  padding: 3px 5px;
  background: var(--waz-raised);
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 13px;
}

.waz-process-row span {
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-process-row .waz-process-owner { color: var(--waz-muted); }
.waz-process-row .waz-process-cpu { color: var(--waz-cyan); text-align: right; }
.waz-process-row .waz-process-memory { color: var(--waz-violet); text-align: right; }

.waz-inspector-section { flex: 0 0 auto; }

.waz-inspector-header {
  justify-content: flex-start;
  min-height: 35px;
}

.waz-selected-icon {
  display: grid;
  width: 34px;
  height: 34px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  place-items: center;
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-size: 22px;
}

.waz-selected-icon img { width: 32px; height: 32px; object-fit: contain; }

.waz-inspector-title { min-width: 0; flex: 1 1 auto; }
.waz-inspector-title b,
.waz-inspector-title small {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.waz-inspector-title b { font-size: 12px; line-height: 15px; }
.waz-inspector-title small { color: var(--waz-muted); font-size: 9.5px; line-height: 12px; }

.waz-selected-badge {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 9px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .06em;
}
.waz-selected-badge.waz-running { color: var(--waz-green); }
.waz-selected-badge.waz-paused { color: var(--waz-amber); }
.waz-selected-badge.waz-stopped,
.waz-selected-badge.waz-unhealthy { color: var(--waz-red); }

.waz-selected-metrics {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 1px;
  margin-top: 6px;
  padding: 1px;
  background: var(--waz-border);
}

.waz-selected-metrics > div { min-width: 0; padding: 5px 6px; background: var(--waz-raised); }
.waz-selected-metrics strong {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-cyan);
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 14px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.waz-selected-metrics > div:nth-child(2) strong,
.waz-selected-metrics > div:nth-child(5) strong { color: var(--waz-violet); }

.waz-selected-charts {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 5px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-selected-charts > div {
  position: relative;
  height: 38px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid rgb(135 147 159 / 16%);
  background: var(--waz-bg);
}

.waz-selected-charts span {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: 1;
  top: 2px;
  left: 4px;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 7.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.waz-selected-charts svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.waz-selected-charts polyline {
  fill: none;
  stroke: var(--waz-cyan);
  stroke-width: 1.6;
  stroke-linejoin: round;
  vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
}
.waz-selected-charts > div:nth-child(2) polyline { stroke: var(--waz-violet); }
.waz-selected-charts > div:nth-child(3) polyline { stroke: var(--waz-teal); }

.waz-selected-detail-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr 1.25fr;
  gap: 5px;
  margin-top: 6px;
}

.waz-selected-detail-grid > div {
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 4px 5px;
  background: var(--waz-raised);
}

.waz-selected-detail-grid span {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 1px;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--waz-text);
  font-size: 9px;
  line-height: 12px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.waz-workloads-footer {
  padding: 6px 2px 0;
  color: var(--waz-muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  line-height: 13px;
}

.waz-workloads-muted { color: var(--waz-muted); font-size: 10px; }

@media (max-width: 620px) {
  .waz-workloads { height: auto !important; overflow: visible; }
  .waz-workloads-summary { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .waz-folder-tabs { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .waz-container-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); max-height: none; }
  .waz-selected-metrics { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .waz-selected-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

]]>
</INLINE>
</FILE>
<FILE Name="/usr/local/emhttp/plugins/.waz.dashboard.staged/assets/js/banner.js">
<INLINE>
<![CDATA[
(function () {
  "use strict";

  if (window.WAZHealth && window.WAZHealth.version) return;

  var config = window.WAZHealthBootstrap || {};
  var endpoint = config.endpoint || "/plugins/waz.dashboard/include/status.php";
  var fanEndpoint = config.fanEndpoint || "/plugins/md12xx.fancontrol/include/api.php";
  var fanAvailable = config.fanAvailable !== false;
  // Unraid publishes the current session token as a page-global variable.
  var csrfToken = String(window.csrf_token || config.csrfToken || "");
  var refreshMs = Math.max(3000, Number(config.refreshMs) || 5000);
  var allowedStates = ["normal", "attention", "fault", "unknown"];
  var subsystemOrder = ["array", "storage", "cooling", "ups"];
  var state = {
    server: { label: "WAZ-SERVER", uptimeSeconds: null },
    overall: { label: "SYSTEM NORMAL", state: "normal", message: "" },
    subsystems: {},
    healthSubsystems: {},
    healthOverall: { label: "SYSTEM NORMAL", state: "normal", message: "" },
    fans: { available: false, enabled: false, mode: "auto", manualSpeed: 20, allowedManualSpeeds: [], healthState: "unknown", shelves: [] },
    uptimeSampledAt: Date.now()
  };
  var banner = null;
  var refreshTimer = null;
  var clockTimer = null;
  var resizeObserver = null;
  var fanBusy = false;


  var dashboardTelemetry = window.WAZDashboardTelemetry || {};
  function dashboardIssues(now) {
    var result = [];
    Object.keys(dashboardTelemetry).forEach(function (key) {
      var item = dashboardTelemetry[key];
      if (['storage', 'workloads', 'system'].indexOf(key) < 0 || !item) return;
      var stale = item.stale || now - item.receivedAt > (key === 'system' ? 8000 : 20000);
      var messages = stale ? [key + ' telemetry unavailable; showing last snapshot'] : item.messages || [];
      messages.forEach(function (message) { result.push({ label: key.toUpperCase(), state: stale ? 'fault' : normalizeState(item.state), message: String(message), source: key }); });
    });
    return result.filter(function (item) { return stateRank(item.state) > 0; });
  }

  function normalizeState(value) {
    value = String(value || "unknown").toLowerCase();
    return allowedStates.indexOf(value) >= 0 ? value : "unknown";
  }

  function escapeText(value) {
    return String(value == null ? "" : value);
  }

  function formatUptime(seconds) {
    if (!Number.isFinite(seconds) || seconds < 0) return "—";
    var totalMinutes = Math.floor(seconds / 60);
    var days = Math.floor(totalMinutes / 1440);
    var hours = Math.floor((totalMinutes % 1440) / 60);
    var minutes = totalMinutes % 60;
    if (days > 0) return days + "d " + hours + "h";
    if (hours > 0) return hours + "h " + minutes + "m";
    return minutes + "m";
  }

  function localTime() {
    return new Intl.DateTimeFormat(undefined, {
      hour: "numeric",
      minute: "2-digit"
    }).format(new Date());
  }

  function createIndicator(key, label) {
    var item = document.createElement("span");
    item.className = "waz-health__subsystem";
    item.dataset.subsystem = key;

    var name = document.createElement("span");
    name.className = "waz-health__subsystem-label";
    name.textContent = label;

    var dot = document.createElement("span");
    dot.className = "waz-health__dot";
    dot.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");

    item.appendChild(name);
    item.appendChild(dot);
    return item;
  }

  function openDashboardModules() {
    if (typeof window.contentMgmt === "function") window.contentMgmt();
  }

  function updateDashboardModulesControl() {
    if (!banner) return;
    var control = banner.querySelector(".waz-health__modules");
    if (control) control.hidden = typeof window.contentMgmt !== "function";
  }

  function stateRank(value) {
    return { unknown: 0, normal: 0, attention: 1, fault: 2 }[normalizeState(value)] || 0;
  }

  function normalizeFanStatus(payload) {
    payload = payload && typeof payload === "object" ? payload : {};
    var controller = payload.controller && typeof payload.controller === "object" ? payload.controller : {};
    var watchdog = payload.watchdog && typeof payload.watchdog === "object" ? payload.watchdog : {};
    var watchdogFault = ["restarting", "recovering", "fault"].indexOf(String(watchdog.state || "").toLowerCase()) >= 0;
    var enabled = payload.enabled === true;
    var healthState = !enabled ? "unknown" : (watchdogFault || payload.stale ? "fault" : normalizeState(controller.state || "normal"));
    var message = watchdogFault
      ? (watchdog.message || "MD12xx controller restart in progress")
      : payload.stale
      ? "MD12xx controller status is stale"
      : (controller.message || "");
    return {
      available: payload.md12xxAvailable !== false,
      ipmi: payload.ipmi && typeof payload.ipmi === 'object' ? payload.ipmi : null,
      version: payload.version || "",
      enabled: enabled,
      mode: payload.mode === "manual" ? "manual" : "auto",
      manualSpeed: Number(payload.manualSpeed) || 20,
      allowedManualSpeeds: Array.isArray(payload.allowedManualSpeeds) ? payload.allowedManualSpeeds : [],
      healthState: healthState,
      message: message,
      stale: payload.stale === true,
      controller: controller,
      watchdog: watchdog,
      shelves: Array.isArray(payload.shelves) ? payload.shelves : []
    };
  }

  function applyFanHealth() {
    state.subsystems = Object.assign({}, state.healthSubsystems || {});
    state.overall = Object.assign({}, state.healthOverall || state.overall);
    var fans = state.fans || {};
    var ipmi = fans.ipmi || {};
    if (ipmi.supported && (ipmi.state === 'fault' || (ipmi.stale && ipmi.config && ipmi.config.enabled))) {
      var chassisMessage = ipmi.stale ? 'Chassis cooling status is stale' : (ipmi.message || 'Chassis cooling requires attention');
      state.subsystems.cooling = Object.assign({}, state.subsystems.cooling || {}, { label: 'COOLING', state: 'fault', message: chassisMessage });
      state.overall = Object.assign({}, state.overall, { label: 'FAULT', state: 'fault', message: chassisMessage });
    }
    if (!fans.available || !fans.enabled || stateRank(fans.healthState) === 0) return;
    var cooling = Object.assign({ label: "COOLING", state: "unknown", message: "" }, state.subsystems.cooling || {});
    if (stateRank(fans.healthState) > stateRank(cooling.state)) {
      cooling.state = normalizeState(fans.healthState);
      cooling.message = fans.message || "MD12xx fan control requires attention";
      cooling.metrics = Object.assign({}, cooling.metrics || {}, { md12xx: fans });
      state.subsystems.cooling = cooling;
    }
    if (stateRank(fans.healthState) > stateRank(state.overall.state)) {
      state.overall.state = normalizeState(fans.healthState);
      state.overall.label = state.overall.state === "fault" ? "FAULT" : "ATTENTION";
      state.overall.message = fans.message || "MD12xx fan control requires attention";
    }
  }

  function setFanMode(value) {
    if (fanBusy || !fanAvailable || !state.fans.enabled) return;
    var manual = value !== "auto";
    var speed = manual ? Number(value) : Number(state.fans.manualSpeed || 20);
    var prompt = manual
      ? "Set all enabled MD12xx shelves to " + speed + "% manual fan speed?"
      : "Return all enabled MD12xx shelves to automatic temperature control?";
    if (!window.confirm(prompt)) {
      renderFans();
      return;
    }

    fanBusy = true;
    renderFans();
    if (!csrfToken) {
      fanBusy = false;
      renderFans();
      window.alert("The current Unraid session token is unavailable; reload this page and try again");
      return;
    }
    var body = new URLSearchParams();
    body.set("action", "control");
    body.set("csrf_token", csrfToken);
    body.set("mode", manual ? "manual" : "auto");
    if (manual) body.set("speed", String(speed));
    fetch(fanEndpoint, {
      method: "POST",
      credentials: "same-origin",
      cache: "no-store",
      headers: { "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded", Accept: "application/json" },
      body: body.toString()
    })
      .then(function (response) {
        return response.json().then(function (payload) {
          if (!response.ok) throw new Error(payload.error || "Fan control update failed");
          state.fans = normalizeFanStatus(payload.status || payload);
          applyFanHealth();
        });
      })
      .catch(function (error) {
        window.alert(error.message || "Fan control update failed");
      })
      .finally(function () {
        fanBusy = false;
        renderFans();
        window.setTimeout(refresh, 1200);
      });
  }

  function createFanControl() {
    var control = document.createElement("span");
    control.className = "waz-health__fans";
    control.dataset.field = "fans";
    control.hidden = true;
    control.innerHTML = '<span class="waz-health__fans-label"><span class="waz-health__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>MD12XX</span>' +
      '<span class="waz-health__fan-readings"></span>';

    var select = document.createElement("select");
    select.className = "waz-health__fan-select";
    select.setAttribute("aria-label", "MD12xx fan control mode and manual speed");
    var automatic = document.createElement("option");
    automatic.value = "auto";
    automatic.textContent = "AUTO";
    select.appendChild(automatic);
    select.addEventListener("change", function () { setFanMode(select.value); });
    control.appendChild(select);
    return control;
  }

  function createBanner() {
    var root = document.createElement("section");
    root.id = "waz-health-banner";
    root.className = "waz-health";
    root.setAttribute("role", "status");
    root.setAttribute("aria-live", "polite");
    root.setAttribute("aria-label", "WAZ server health");

    var inner = document.createElement("div");
    inner.className = "waz-health__inner";

    var identity = document.createElement("span");
    identity.className = "waz-health__identity";
    identity.dataset.field = "server";

    var overall = document.createElement("span");
    overall.className = "waz-health__overall";
    overall.innerHTML = '<span class="waz-health__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-field="overall">SYSTEM NORMAL</span>';

    var dividerOne = document.createElement("span");
    dividerOne.className = "waz-health__divider";
    dividerOne.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");

    var subsystems = document.createElement("span");
    subsystems.className = "waz-health__subsystems";
    subsystemOrder.forEach(function (key) {
      subsystems.appendChild(createIndicator(key, key.toUpperCase()));
    });

    var dividerTwo = dividerOne.cloneNode(true);
    dividerTwo.classList.add("waz-health__fan-divider");

    var fanControl = createFanControl();

    var dividerThree = dividerOne.cloneNode(true);
    dividerThree.classList.add("waz-health__fan-divider");

    var meta = document.createElement("span");
    meta.className = "waz-health__meta";

    var modules = document.createElement("button");
    modules.type = "button";
    modules.className = "waz-health__modules";
    modules.hidden = true;
    modules.title = "Manage dashboard modules";
    modules.setAttribute("aria-label", "Manage dashboard modules");
    var modulesIcon = document.createElement("i");
    modulesIcon.className = "fa fa-fw fa-wrench";
    modulesIcon.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
    modules.appendChild(modulesIcon);
    modules.addEventListener("click", openDashboardModules);

    meta.appendChild(modules);
    meta.insertAdjacentHTML("beforeend", '<time class="waz-health__time" data-field="time"></time><span class="waz-health__uptime"><span aria-hidden="true">↑</span><span data-field="uptime">—</span></span>');

    inner.appendChild(identity);
    inner.appendChild(overall);
    inner.appendChild(dividerOne);
    inner.appendChild(subsystems);
    inner.appendChild(dividerTwo);
    var right = document.createElement("span");
    right.className = "waz-health__right";
    var chassis = document.createElement('a');
    chassis.className = 'waz-health__fans';
    chassis.dataset.field = 'chassis';
    chassis.href = '/MD12xxFanControl';
    chassis.hidden = true;
    chassis.title = 'Open chassis cooling controls';
    right.appendChild(chassis);
    right.appendChild(fanControl);
    right.appendChild(dividerThree);
    right.appendChild(meta);
    inner.appendChild(right);
    root.appendChild(inner);

    var issues = document.createElement("div");
    issues.className = "waz-health__issues";
    issues.dataset.field = "issues";
    issues.setAttribute("aria-label", "Active health details");
    root.appendChild(issues);
    return root;
  }

  function renderIssues() {
    if (!banner) return;
    var issuesNode = banner.querySelector('[data-field="issues"]');
    if (!issuesNode) return;

    var activeIssues = dashboardIssues(Date.now());
    subsystemOrder.forEach(function (key) {
      var value = state.subsystems[key] || {};
      var issueState = normalizeState(value.state);
      if (issueState !== "attention" && issueState !== "fault") return;
      if ((key === 'array' || key === 'storage') && activeIssues.some(function (i) { return i.source === 'storage' && stateRank(i.state) >= stateRank(issueState); })) return;
      activeIssues.push({
        label: value.label || key.toUpperCase(),
        state: issueState,
        message: value.message || ((value.label || key.toUpperCase()) + " reported " + issueState)
      });
    });

    var overallState = normalizeState(state.overall.state);
    if (!activeIssues.length && (overallState === "attention" || overallState === "fault")) {
      activeIssues.push({
        label: state.overall.label || "SYSTEM",
        state: overallState,
        message: state.overall.message || "System health requires attention"
      });
    }

    activeIssues.sort(function (left, right) {
      var rank = { fault: 2, attention: 1 };
      return (rank[right.state] || 0) - (rank[left.state] || 0);
    });

    var seen = {};
    activeIssues = activeIssues.filter(function (issue) { var key = issue.message.toLowerCase().trim(); if (seen[key]) return false; seen[key] = true; return true; });
    var overallNode = banner.querySelector('[data-field="overall"]');
    var overallDot = banner.querySelector('.waz-health__overall');
    if (activeIssues.length) {
      if (overallNode) overallNode.textContent = 'NEEDS ATTENTION · ' + activeIssues.length;
      if (overallDot) overallDot.dataset.state = activeIssues.some(function (i) { return i.state === 'fault'; }) ? 'fault' : 'attention';
    } else if (Object.keys(state.healthSubsystems || {}).length && normalizeState(state.overall.state) === 'normal' && !Object.keys(state.healthSubsystems).some(function (k) { return normalizeState(state.healthSubsystems[k].state) === 'unknown'; })) {
      if (overallNode) overallNode.textContent = 'ALL CLEAR';
    }
    issuesNode.replaceChildren();
    activeIssues.forEach(function (issue) {
      var item = document.createElement("span");
      item.className = "waz-health__issue";
      item.dataset.state = issue.state;

      var dot = document.createElement("span");
      dot.className = "waz-health__dot";
      dot.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");

      var label = document.createElement("strong");
      label.textContent = issue.label;

      var message = document.createElement("span");
      message.textContent = issue.message;

      item.appendChild(dot);
      item.appendChild(label);
      item.appendChild(message);
      issuesNode.appendChild(item);
    });

    banner.classList.toggle("waz-health--expanded", activeIssues.length > 0);
  }

  function updateClockAndUptime() {
    if (!banner) return;
    var timeNode = banner.querySelector('[data-field="time"]');
    var uptimeNode = banner.querySelector('[data-field="uptime"]');
    if (timeNode) {
      timeNode.textContent = localTime();
      timeNode.setAttribute("datetime", new Date().toISOString());
    }
    if (uptimeNode) {
      var elapsed = Math.max(0, (Date.now() - state.uptimeSampledAt) / 1000);
      var seconds = Number(state.server.uptimeSeconds);
      uptimeNode.textContent = formatUptime(Number.isFinite(seconds) ? seconds + elapsed : NaN);
    }
  }

  function render() {
    if (!banner) return;
    var serverNode = banner.querySelector('[data-field="server"]');
    var overallNode = banner.querySelector('[data-field="overall"]');
    var overall = banner.querySelector(".waz-health__overall");

    if (serverNode) serverNode.textContent = escapeText(state.server.label || "WAZ-SERVER");
    if (overallNode) overallNode.textContent = escapeText(state.overall.label || "STATUS UNKNOWN");
    if (overall) overall.dataset.state = normalizeState(state.overall.state);

    subsystemOrder.forEach(function (key) {
      var item = banner.querySelector('[data-subsystem="' + key + '"]');
      var value = state.subsystems[key] || { label: key.toUpperCase(), state: "unknown" };
      if (!item) return;
      item.hidden = key === 'ups' && value.metrics && value.metrics.available === false && normalizeState(value.state) === 'normal';
      item.dataset.state = normalizeState(value.state);
      var label = item.querySelector(".waz-health__subsystem-label");
      if (label) label.textContent = escapeText(value.label || key.toUpperCase());
      item.setAttribute("aria-label", (value.label || key) + ": " + normalizeState(value.state));
    });

    renderFans();

    renderIssues();
    updateClockAndUptime();
    updateDashboardModulesControl();
  }

  function renderFans() {
    if (!banner) return;
    var control = banner.querySelector('[data-field="fans"]');
    if (!control) return;
    var fans = state.fans || {};
    var available = fans.available === true;
    var ipmi = fans.ipmi || {};
    var chassis = banner.querySelector('[data-field="chassis"]');
    var chassisAvailable = ipmi.available === true;
    if (chassis) {
      chassis.hidden = !chassisAvailable;
      chassis.dataset.state = ipmi.stale || ipmi.state === 'fault' ? 'fault' : 'normal';
      chassis.textContent = 'IPMI · ' + (ipmi.stale ? 'STALE' : ipmi.mode === 'firmware' ? 'iDRAC AUTO' : ((ipmi.mode === 'manual' ? 'MANUAL ' : 'CURVE ') + (ipmi.targetPercent == null ? '—' : ipmi.targetPercent + '%'))) + (Number.isFinite(ipmi.averageRpm) ? ' · ' + ipmi.averageRpm + ' RPM' : '');
    }
    var enabled = fans.enabled === true;
    var mode = fans.mode === "manual" ? "manual" : "auto";
    var select = control.querySelector("select");
    var readings = control.querySelector(".waz-health__fan-readings");
    control.hidden = !available;
    Array.prototype.forEach.call(banner.querySelectorAll(".waz-health__fan-divider"), function (divider) {
      divider.hidden = !available && !chassisAvailable;
    });
    if (!available) return;
    control.dataset.state = enabled ? normalizeState(fans.healthState || "unknown") : "unknown";
    control.classList.toggle("waz-health__fans--disabled", !enabled);
    control.classList.toggle("waz-health__fans--manual", mode === "manual");
    if (select) {
      var speeds = (Array.isArray(fans.allowedManualSpeeds) ? fans.allowedManualSpeeds : [])
        .map(Number)
        .filter(function (speed, index, values) { return Number.isFinite(speed) && speed >= 20 && speed <= 100 && values.indexOf(speed) === index; })
        .sort(function (left, right) { return left - right; });
      var signature = speeds.join(",");
      if (select.dataset.speeds !== signature) {
        select.replaceChildren();
        var automatic = document.createElement("option");
        automatic.value = "auto";
        automatic.textContent = "AUTO";
        select.appendChild(automatic);
        speeds.forEach(function (speed) {
          var option = document.createElement("option");
          option.value = String(speed);
          option.textContent = "MANUAL " + speed + "%";
          select.appendChild(option);
        });
        select.dataset.speeds = signature;
      }
      select.value = mode === "manual" ? String(fans.manualSpeed || 20) : "auto";
      select.disabled = !enabled || fanBusy;
      select.title = enabled ? "Controls all enabled MD12xx shelves through the fan-control plugin" : "Enable the controller in the MD12xx Fan Control plugin";
    }
    if (readings) readings.hidden = mode !== "auto";
    if (readings) {
      readings.replaceChildren();
      (fans.shelves || []).forEach(function (shelf, index) {
        var node = document.createElement("span");
        var label = String(shelf.name || shelf.model || ("SHELF " + (index + 1))).replace(/^MD12(?:00|20)\s*/i, "").trim();
        var rpm = Number(shelf.averageRpm);
        node.textContent = (label || ("SHELF " + (index + 1))).toUpperCase() + " " + (Number.isFinite(rpm) && rpm > 0 ? Math.round(rpm) + " RPM" : "—");
        node.title = [
          shelf.name || shelf.model || ("MD12xx shelf " + (index + 1)),
          shelf.temperatureC == null ? "temperature unavailable" : shelf.temperatureC + "°C from " + (shelf.temperatureSource || "assigned disks"),
          shelf.targetPercent == null ? "target unavailable" : shelf.targetPercent + "% target",
          shelf.telemetryMessage || "fan telemetry current"
        ].join(" · ");
        readings.appendChild(node);
      });
    }
    control.setAttribute("aria-label", enabled
      ? "MD12xx fan control: " + mode + (mode === "manual" ? " at " + fans.manualSpeed + " percent" : "")
      : "MD12xx fan control is disabled");
  }

  function mergeSnapshot(next) {
    if (!next || typeof next !== "object") return;
    if (next.server && typeof next.server === "object") {
      state.server = Object.assign({}, state.server, next.server);
      if (next.server.uptimeSeconds != null) state.uptimeSampledAt = Date.now();
    }
    if (next.overall && typeof next.overall === "object") {
      state.healthOverall = Object.assign({}, state.healthOverall, next.overall);
    }
    if (next.subsystems && typeof next.subsystems === "object") {
      state.healthSubsystems = Object.assign({}, next.subsystems);
    }
    applyFanHealth();
    render();
  }

  function refresh() {
    var healthRequest = fetch(endpoint, {
      credentials: "same-origin",
      cache: "no-store",
      headers: { Accept: "application/json" }
    })
      .then(function (response) {
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error("WAZ Health endpoint returned " + response.status);
        return response.json();
      })
      .then(function (snapshot) { return snapshot; });
    var fanRequest = !fanAvailable ? Promise.resolve({ available: false, enabled: false }) : fetch(fanEndpoint + "?_=" + Date.now(), {
      credentials: "same-origin",
      cache: "no-store",
      headers: { Accept: "application/json" }
    })
      .then(function (response) {
        if (response.status === 404 || response.status === 410) fanAvailable = false;
        if (!response.ok) throw new Error("MD12xx Fan Control endpoint returned " + response.status);
        return response.json();
      })
      .then(normalizeFanStatus)
      .catch(function () {
        return { available: false, enabled: false, mode: "auto", manualSpeed: 20, allowedManualSpeeds: [], healthState: "unknown", shelves: [] };
      });

    return Promise.all([healthRequest, fanRequest])
      .then(function (results) {
        var snapshot = results[0];
        state.fans = results[1];
        mergeSnapshot(snapshot);
        if (banner) banner.dataset.connection = "online";
        return snapshot;
      })
      .catch(function (error) {
        if (banner) banner.dataset.connection = "offline";
        if (window.console && console.debug) console.debug("WAZ Health refresh failed", error);
        return null;
      });
  }

  function updateStickyOffset(menu) {
    if (!banner || !menu) return;
    var style = window.getComputedStyle(menu);
    var navIsTopSticky = style.position === "sticky" && document.documentElement.classList.contains("Theme--nav-top");
    banner.style.setProperty("--waz-health-sticky-top", navIsTopSticky ? menu.offsetHeight + "px" : "0px");
  }

  function mount() {
    if (document.getElementById("waz-health-banner")) {
      banner = document.getElementById("waz-health-banner");
      return;
    }

    var menu = document.getElementById("menu");
    var display = document.getElementById("displaybox");
    banner = createBanner();

    if (menu && menu.parentNode) {
      menu.insertAdjacentElement("afterend", banner);
      updateStickyOffset(menu);
      if (window.ResizeObserver) {
        resizeObserver = new ResizeObserver(function () { updateStickyOffset(menu); });
        resizeObserver.observe(menu);
      } else {
        window.addEventListener("resize", function () { updateStickyOffset(menu); });
      }
    } else if (display && display.parentNode) {
      display.parentNode.insertBefore(banner, display);
    } else {
      document.body.insertBefore(banner, document.body.firstChild);
    }

    render();
    refresh();
    refreshTimer = window.setInterval(refresh, refreshMs);
    clockTimer = window.setInterval(updateClockAndUptime, 60000);
  }

  window.WAZHealth = {
    version: "0.8.5",
    refresh: refresh,
    dashboardUpdate: function (section, payload) {
      dashboardTelemetry[section] = payload;
      render();
    },
    setState: function (next) {
      mergeSnapshot(next);
      return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(state));
    },
    getState: function () {
      return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(state));
    },
    destroy: function () {
      if (refreshTimer) window.clearInterval(refreshTimer);
      if (clockTimer) window.clearInterval(clockTimer);
      if (resizeObserver) resizeObserver.disconnect();
      if (banner && banner.parentNode) banner.parentNode.removeChild(banner);
      banner = null;
    }
  };

  if (document.readyState === "loading") {
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", mount, { once: true });
  } else {
    mount();
  }
})();

]]>
</INLINE>
